tasks.description:
创建 Note 模型用于存储笔记数据。在 app/models/ 目录下创建 note.py 文件，定义字段: id (唯一标识), title (笔记标题), content (笔记内容), created_at (创建时间), updated_at (更新时间)。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

实现笔记的 CRUD API 路由。在 app/routes/ 下创建 notes.py 文件，定义增删改查接口，连接数据库模型 Note。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

设计笔记管理的前端页面。在 templates/ 下创建 notes.html 文件，包含笔记创建表单、笔记列表展示区域，以及编辑和删除操作按钮。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在后端实现搜索功能，支持通过标题或内容关键字查询笔记。在 app/routes/notes.py 文件中添加搜索接口，并更新前端页面以支持搜索表单。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
- GET /notes/search (request: {query: str}) -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]

实现笔记分类和标签功能。在 app/models/note.py 中添加分类和标签字段，并更新前端页面和后端 API 支持分类和标签的增删改查。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str, category: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, category, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, category, tags, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, category, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str, category: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, category, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
